To see the inner product, first recall the discrete calculation: $\begin{aligned}
\braket{\psi}{\phi}
&=
\sum_{a',a}
\psi^*(a')\braket{a'}{a}\phi(a) \notag\\
&=
\sum_a\psi^*(a)\phi(a).
\end{aligned}$ The complex-conjugated coefficients belong to the bra, and orthonormality collapses the double sum.

